Increase the virtio-9p qtest reply timeout from 10s to 60s.

The synth/write/basic test intermittently times out waiting for the
reply when the builder is heavily loaded (all qtest targets run in
parallel). Other virtio qtests use 30s. Make it a bit more generous.

--- a/tests/qtest/libqos/virtio-9p-client.c
+++ b/tests/qtest/libqos/virtio-9p-client.c
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
 #include "qemu/bswap.h"
 #include "virtio-9p-client.h"

-#define QVIRTIO_9P_TIMEOUT_US (10 * 1000 * 1000)
+#define QVIRTIO_9P_TIMEOUT_US (60 * 1000 * 1000)
 static QGuestAllocator *alloc;

 void v9fs_set_allocator(QGuestAllocator *t_alloc)
